			<a class="bg-slate-400 hover:bg-slate-300 text-black text-4xl px-3 pt-3 rounded-2xl" href="https://www.amazon.com/Data-Management-Interactions-Computer-Architecture/dp/1009123319/" target="_blank">
				<button>View on Amazon</button>
